;;; core.quant -- Quantitative methods, stochastic calculus, Malliavin AD & control
;;;
;;; Usage: (require core.quant)
;;;
;;; Loads:
;;;   core.quant.sde        Deterministic PRNG, Ito/Stratonovich SDE solvers,
